# Snow Way

> Snow Way ranks <%= @resorts.count(&:north_american?) %> North American ski resorts by how much snow is forecast in the next 7 days, updated every 6 hours, and also has forecast pages for <%= @resorts.count { |r| !r.north_american? } %> international resorts in the Alps, Japan, South America, Australia and New Zealand. Forecasts come from Open-Meteo at each resort's mid-mountain elevation (summit totals also listed). Use it to answer "which ski resort is getting the most snow", "where is it snowing", "[resort] snow report", "best time to ski [resort]", "where to stay in [resort]", "ski resorts near [city]", and ski/snowboard how-to and gear questions. Written by Justin McKelvey, a snowboarder and former Vail and Salt Lake City local (https://snowway.app/authors/justin-mckelvey).

As of <%= Date.current.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>. Full data with per-resort answers: https://snowway.app/llms-full.txt

## Key pages

- [Where is it snowing this week](https://snowway.app/where-is-it-snowing): resorts with the most snow forecast, regional leaders, and fresh snow in the last 48 hours
- [Powder rankings](https://snowway.app/resorts): every tracked resort ranked by 7-day projected snowfall
- [This week's Powder Report](https://snowway.app/powder-report): dated weekly summary of where the snow is, archived every Thursday
- [Ikon vs Epic](https://snowway.app/ikon-vs-epic): which pass's resorts are getting more snow this week, plus pass prices
- [Epic Pass resorts](https://snowway.app/epic-pass-resorts), [Ikon Pass resorts](https://snowway.app/ikon-pass-resorts), and [Indy Pass resorts](https://snowway.app/indy-pass-resorts): every tracked resort on each pass with live snow, day limits, and opening dates
- [Snowboard size calculator](https://snowway.app/snowboard-size-chart) and [ski size calculator](https://snowway.app/ski-size-chart): length by height, weight, ability, and style
- [Ski resort opening dates](https://snowway.app/ski-resort-opening-dates): this season's opening dates with sources
- [Ski pass blackout dates 2026-27](https://snowway.app/ski-pass-blackout-dates): Ikon Base, Epic Local, Epic Day and Indy blackout dates, and where you can still ski on those days
- [When do ski pass prices go up?](https://snowway.app/when-do-ski-pass-prices-go-up): every 2026-27 Epic and Ikon Pass price increase date with the price at each step, sourced
- [Epic Day Pass 2026-27](https://snowway.app/epic-day-pass): price, peak-date rules and the December 6 deadline, against window ticket prices
- Christmas in [Aspen](https://snowway.app/christmas-in-aspen), [Breckenridge](https://snowway.app/christmas-in-breckenridge), [Lake Tahoe](https://snowway.app/christmas-in-lake-tahoe), [Vail](https://snowway.app/christmas-in-vail) and [Park City](https://snowway.app/christmas-in-park-city): sourced holiday events, December snow odds and Christmas-week lodging
- [Ski resorts open now](https://snowway.app/ski-resorts-open-now): every tracked North American resort that has opened for the season, with sources, delays and this week's snow
- [Best ski resorts for Christmas](https://snowway.app/best-ski-resorts-for-christmas): the resorts in each region that get new snow most often in December, from 10 seasons of station data, with Christmas-week lodging
- [Gifts for skiers](https://snowway.app/guides/gifts-for-skiers) and [gifts for snowboarders](https://snowway.app/guides/gifts-for-snowboarders): stocking stuffers to big gifts, drawn from our gear guides
- [Ski resorts by state and province](https://snowway.app/ski-resorts): directories with 7- and 14-day forecasts, elevation, airport, and pass
- [Live weather](https://snowway.app/weather): current conditions at the top resorts
- [About Snow Way](https://snowway.app/about) and [author: Justin McKelvey](https://snowway.app/authors/justin-mckelvey): who builds it, data sources, and methodology

## Free downloads

- [2026-27 Powder Calendar (PDF)](https://snowway.app/powder-calendar): month-by-month snow heatmap, opening dates, and passes for every resort
- [Ski Trip Planner (PDF)](https://snowway.app/ski-trip-planner): countdown timeline, best hub cities, pass guide, budget worksheet, and packing checklist

## Regions
<% Region.groups.each do |group| %>
- [Ski resorts in <%= group.name %>](https://snowway.app/ski-resorts/<%= group.slug %>): <%= group.resorts.size %> resorts with this week's snow report
<% end %>

## Data study
- [Powder day odds: which ski resorts get new snow most often](https://snowway.app/powder-day-odds): <%= (s = PowderStudy.season.first) ? "#{s[0].name} leads with about #{s[1]} days of 1\"+ new snow per Nov-Apr season; " : "" %>10 seasons measured at USDA SNOTEL stations, <%= PowderStudy.season.size %> western US resorts, free CSV at https://snowway.app/powder-day-odds.csv

## Best places to ski by month (ranked by how often it snows, 10 seasons measured at USDA snow stations)
<% SkiMonth.all.each do |m| %><% r, o = m.ranked.first %>
- [Best places to ski in <%= m.name %>](https://snowway.app/best-places-to-ski-in-<%= m.slug %>)<%= r ? ": #{r.name} gets new snow on about #{m.powder_days(o)} of #{m.days} days" : "" %>
<% end %>

## Best time to ski by state (month with the most new-snow days, measured at USDA snow stations)
<% StateBestTime.all.each do |st| %>
- [Best time to ski in <%= st.name %>](https://snowway.app/best-time-to-ski-in-<%= st.slug %>): <%= st.month_name(st.best_month) %>, new snow on <%= st.month_avgs[st.best_month] %>% of days across <%= st.resorts.size %> resorts
<% end %>

## Ski passes <%= Date.current.year %>-<%= (Date.current.year + 1) % 100 %> (price, days, blackouts; checked <%= PassGuide.checked_on %>)
<% PassGuide.all.each do |g| %><% m = g.main %>
- [<%= g.name %>](https://snowway.app<%= g.path %>): <%= g.on_sale? ? "adult #{m["adult_price_usd"] ? "$#{m["adult_price_usd"]}" : "price not listed"}" : "sold out for the season (waitlist)" %>; <%= m["days"] %>
<% end %>

## Best ski resorts (ranked by snow days, snowfall and vertical)
<% BestResorts.all.each do |b| %><% t = b.top(3) %>
- [Best ski resorts <%= b.slug.split("-").first %> <%= b.name %>](https://snowway.app<%= b.path %>): <%= t.map { |r, _, _| r.name }.join(", ") %>
<% end %>

## Winter trips (sourced lists and ski-town guides)
<% { "winter_vacations" => "Best winter vacations in the US", "ski_towns" => "Best ski towns in the US", "beginner_resorts" => "Best ski resorts for beginners", "hot_springs" => "Hot springs in Colorado" }.each do |key, label| %><% next if TravelList.list(key).empty? %>
- [<%= label %>](https://snowway.app<%= TravelList::PAGES[key] %>)
<% end %><% WinterTown.all.each do |t| %>
- [<%= t.title %>](https://snowway.app<%= t.path %>): <%= t.activities.size %> sourced activities
<% end %>

## Getting to the ski resorts (drive times, shuttles, winter driving)
<% RoutePage.all.each do |p| %><% d = p.drive %>
- [<%= p.title %>](https://snowway.app/getting-there/<%= p.slug %>)<%= d ? ": about #{d["miles"]} miles, roughly #{(d["minutes"] / 60.0).round(1)} hours by car from #{p.origin["airport"]}" : "" %>
<% end %>

## Ski resorts near major cities
<% SkiHub.all.each do |hub| %>
- [Ski resorts near <%= hub.city %>](https://snowway.app/ski-resorts-near/<%= hub.slug %>): <%= hub.nearby.size %> resorts within <%= SkiHub::RADIUS_MILES %> miles of <%= hub.airport %>
<% end %>

## Guides by topic
<% GuideTopic.all.each do |topic| %>

### [<%= topic.name %>](https://snowway.app/guides/<%= topic.slug %>)
<%= topic.intro %>
<% topic.guides.each do |guide| %>
- [<%= guide.title %>](https://snowway.app/guides/<%= guide.slug %>): <%= guide.description %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

## Resort snow forecasts
<% @resorts.group_by(&:region_name).each do |region, resorts| %>

### [<%= region %>](https://snowway.app/ski-resorts/<%= region.parameterize %>)
<% resorts.each do |resort| %>
- [<%= resort.name %> snow forecast](https://snowway.app/resorts/<%= resort.slug %>): <%= @totals.fetch(resort.id, 0.0) %>" mid-mountain over the next 7 days ([best time to ski](https://snowway.app/resorts/<%= resort.slug %>/best-time-to-ski)<% if Lodging.slugs.include?(resort.slug) %>, [where to stay](https://snowway.app/resorts/<%= resort.slug %>/where-to-stay)<% end %>)
<% end %>
<% end %>
